OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering rain will soon clear in the
OL,7,Feast this evening, leaving a mostly
OL,8,Fdry night with clear periods. Some
OL,9,Fisolated fog patches are possible in
OL,10,Fprone spots in the east of the region.
OL,11,FWinds easing for a time overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FOn the whole Sunday promises
OL,14,Fto be a brighter day than Saturday,
OL,15,Falthough a scattering of showers are
OL,16,Flikely to feed across the region in
OL,17,Fthe gusty southwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
