OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fand Tuesday look mild, cloudy and
OL,7,Fwindy with outbreaks of rain,
OL,8,Fespecially in the west. Rain clearing
OL,9,Fearly Wednesday to leave a sunnier day
OL,10,Fwith some isolated showers.
